{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Requires ReaImGui (ReaPack: ReaTeam Extensions). REAPER 6.37+. Enter: insert on selected tracks \u183 ? Cmd+Enter: on selected items \u183 ? Shift+Enter: input FX Images live in /Data/LKSHV FX Browser/images (one PNG/JPG per plugin).\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 A compact button matrix of every stem track. By default a stem is a track whose name ends in "_STM" (any case); right-click > Match track names sets other rules per project, e.g. "bus" or "_stm, bus". Click: mute / unmute the stem. Cmd+click (Ctrl on Windows): solo / unsolo. Shift+click: select the stem and scroll the track list so it is the top track. Right-click: unmute all, unsolo all, dock / undock. Made to live in a REAPER docker. Requires ReaImGui (ReaPack: ReaTeam Extensions).\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Minimal, high-res theme based on Default 7 with Apple HIG-inspired colours, a light arrange area and flat controls for long, comfortable sessions. After installing: Options > Themes > Lukashev Graphite 47.\par}
}
